{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-pq67-6m6q-mj2v","cve_id":"CVE-2025-50181","url":"https://api.github.com/advisories/GHSA-pq67-6m6q-mj2v","html_url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-pq67-6m6q-mj2v","summary":"urllib3 redirects are not disabled when retries are disabled on PoolManager instantiation","description":"urllib3 handles redirects and retries using the same mechanism, which is controlled by the `Retry` object. The most common way to disable redirects is at the request level, as follows:\n\n```python\nresp = urllib3.request(\"GET\", \"https://httpbin.org/redirect/1\", redirect=False)\nprint(resp.status)\n# 302\n```\n\nHowever, it is also possible to disable redirects, for all requests, by instantiating a `PoolManager` and specifying `retries` in a way that disable redirects:\n\n```python\nimport urllib3\n\nhttp = urllib3.PoolManager(retries=0)  # should raise MaxRetryError on redirect\nhttp = urllib3.PoolManager(retries=urllib3.Retry(redirect=0))  # equivalent to the above\nhttp = urllib3.PoolManager(retries=False)  # should return the first response\n\nresp = http.request(\"GET\", \"https://httpbin.org/redirect/1\")\n```\n\nHowever, the `retries` parameter is currently ignored, which means all the above examples don't disable redirects.\n\n## Affected usages\n\nPassing `retries` on `PoolManager` instantiation to disable redirects or restrict their number.\n\nBy default, requests and botocore users are not affected.\n\n## Impact\n\nRedirects are often used to exploit SSRF vulnerabilities. An application attempting to mitigate SSRF or open redirect vulnerabilities by disabling redirects at the PoolManager level will remain vulnerable.\n\n## Remediation\n\nYou can remediate this vulnerability with the following steps:\n\n * Upgrade to a patched version of urllib3. If your organization would benefit from the continued support of urllib3 1.x, please contact [sethmichaellarson@gmail.com](mailto:sethmichaellarson@gmail.com) to discuss sponsorship or contribution opportunities.\n * Disable redirects at the `request()` level instead of the `PoolManager()` level.","type":"reviewed","severity":"medium","repository_advisory_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urllib3/urllib3/security-advisories/GHSA-pq67-6m6q-mj2v","source_code_location":"https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3","identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-pq67-6m6q-mj2v","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2025-50181","type":"CVE"}],"references":["https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/security/advisories/GHSA-pq67-6m6q-mj2v","https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/commit/f05b1329126d5be6de501f9d1e3e36738bc08857","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-50181","https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/releases/tag/2.5.0","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-pq67-6m6q-mj2v"],"published_at":"2025-06-18T17:50:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-22T21:33:24Z","github_reviewed_at":"2025-06-18T17:50:00Z","nvd_published_at":"2025-06-19T01:15:24Z","withdrawn_at":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"pip","name":"urllib3"},"vulnerable_version_range":"< 2.5.0","first_patched_version":"2.5.0","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N","score":5.3},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":0.0}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-601","name":"URL Redirection to Untrusted Site ('Open Redirect')"}],"credits":[{"user":{"login":"sandumjacob","id":36341780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQxNzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36341780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandumjacob","html_url":"https://github.com/sandumjacob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandumjacob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandumjacob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandumjacob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandumjacob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sandumjacob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.g